Package: photocure
Version: 1.2.1
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Safiyu Vattaparambil <dheensafiyu@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-venv, python3-pip, ca-certificates
Description: Intelligent offline photo library curation engine
 Photocure is a local, GPU-accelerated photo library curation engine.
 It scores image quality, detects faces, classifies photos with OpenCLIP,
 groups bursts, and organizes photos with 100% reversible undo.
